OL,3,GNEWSA'I worked on Hitler's bunker
OL,4,Abefore I escaped the Nazis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChes Black is an understated man with a
OL,7,Flife story of tragedy, heroism and
OL,8,Fresilience.
OL,10,FThe 101-year-old was taken from his
OL,11,Fhome in Warsaw, Poland, by German
OL,12,Ftroops in 1939, as the Third Reich lit
OL,13,Fthe spark that began World War Two.
OL,15,FThat single event set off a chain of
OL,16,Fevents in his life that have ended with
OL,17,Fhim living a quiet life in an
OL,18,FOxfordshire village.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
