OL,3,GNEWSA'I worked on Hitler's bunker
OL,4,Abefore I escaped the Nazis'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut between German capture and rural
OL,7,Fretirement, the centenarian has lived a
OL,8,Flife - encompassing everything from
OL,9,Fworking on Adolf Hitler's fated Berlin
OL,10,Fbunker to a cunning escape straight out
OL,11,Fof a Hollywood movie.
